{
    "title": "Unity by Hard Rock",
    "description": "Experience Unity\u2122 by Hard Rock, a loyalty program like no other. Join us on a remarkable journey where you can earn and redeem incredible rewards while doing what you love at participating Hard Rock Hotels, Cafes, Casinos, Rock Shops, and more.\r\n\r\nWith the Unity by Hard Rock app, you'll always have your Unity information and status at your fingertips. Get ready for a world of personalized rewards and exhilarating experiences. Stay connected to all our participating locations worldwide, and let the rewards follow you wherever you find your fun.\r\n\r\nHere's what the Unity App can do for you:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tWatch as your Tier Credits accumulate and experience the satisfaction of rising through the tiers. \r\n\u2022\tMonitor your Unity Points as you get closer to unlocking incredible rewards that await you.\r\n\u2022\tAccess exclusive offers, promotions, and rewards tailored specifically to your preferences and activities.\r\n\u2022\tGain exclusive access to entertainment and special events, ensuring unforgettable experiences.\r\n\u2022\tUnlock the lowest member rates at select hotels, allowing you to enjoy exceptional savings.\r\n\u2022\tView all your upcoming casino, hotel, and dining reservations in one place, simplifying your planning process.\r\n\u2022\tEasily update your communications preferences and stay informed about the latest happenings at your favorite locations.\r\n\u2022\tReceive push notifications to stay informed about the latest news, expiring balances, and upcoming reservations. Never miss out on exciting opportunities with our timely alerts.\r\n\u2022\tView your history of eligible transactions within the last 12 months.\r\n\u2022\tExplore all your visited locations to see a comprehensive overview of your global journey.\r\n\u2022\tRequest your casino Win/Loss statements.\r\n\u2022\tAccess your account number and effortlessly scan your digital card at participating locations. Scan to pay with Unity Points at participating locations or to swiftly check-in to casino events.\r\n\u2022\tGamers at Seminole casinos in South Florida can access their U Wallet and enjoy the convenience of using U Wallet as an alternative to cash at a slot machine.\r\nDon't miss a beat\u2014start enjoying our app today!\r\n\r\nGot questions? We've got you covered. Drop us a line at customercare@unitybyhardrock.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Experience Unity\u2122 by Hard Rock, a loyalty program like no other. Join us on a remarkable journey where you can earn and redeem incredible rewards while doing what you love at participating Hard Rock Hotels, Cafes, Casinos, Rock Shops, and more.<br><br>With the Unity by Hard Rock app, you&#39;ll always have your Unity information and status at your fingertips. Get ready for a world of personalized rewards and exhilarating experiences. Stay connected to all our participating locations worldwide, and let the rewards follow you wherever you find your fun.<br><br>Here&#39;s what the Unity App can do for you:<br><br>\u2022\tWatch as your Tier Credits accumulate and experience the satisfaction of rising through the tiers. <br>\u2022\tMonitor your Unity Points as you get closer to unlocking incredible rewards that await you.<br>\u2022\tAccess exclusive offers, promotions, and rewards tailored specifically to your preferences and activities.<br>\u2022\tGain exclusive access to entertainment and special events, ensuring unforgettable experiences.<br>\u2022\tUnlock the lowest member rates at select hotels, allowing you to enjoy exceptional savings.<br>\u2022\tView all your upcoming casino, hotel, and dining reservations in one place, simplifying your planning process.<br>\u2022\tEasily update your communications preferences and stay informed about the latest happenings at your favorite locations.<br>\u2022\tReceive push notifications to stay informed about the latest news, expiring balances, and upcoming reservations. Never miss out on exciting opportunities with our timely alerts.<br>\u2022\tView your history of eligible transactions within the last 12 months.<br>\u2022\tExplore all your visited locations to see a comprehensive overview of your global journey.<br>\u2022\tRequest your casino Win/Loss statements.<br>\u2022\tAccess your account number and effortlessly scan your digital card at participating locations. Scan to pay with Unity Points at participating locations or to swiftly check-in to casino events.<br>\u2022\tGamers at Seminole casinos in South Florida can access their U Wallet and enjoy the convenience of using U Wallet as an alternative to cash at a slot machine.<br>Don&#39;t miss a beat\u2014start enjoying our app today!<br><br>Got questions? We&#39;ve got you covered. Drop us a line at customercare@unitybyhardrock.com.",
